        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "V. The Board shall continue to provide opportunities for CPR training.\nW. Each teacher shall have access in each school center to all School Board Policies, State Board of Education Rules, and Florida School Laws. Copies of policies and rules for each individual school shall be distributed to each teacher in the school. If the individual school does not have written policies and rules, the principal shall advise teachers of the school's policies and rules during pre-planning, then reduce it to writing within ten (10) duty days.",
